**Key techniques demonstrated:**

| Technique | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Typosquatting** | Package name mimics a popular utility |
| **Postinstall trigger** | Runs automatically on `npm install` with no user interaction |
| **Env var scraping** | Regex-matches secret-like variable names |
| **Credential file theft** | Reads AWS, GCP, Azure, and kubeconfig files from disk |
| **CLI token harvesting** | Uses installed cloud CLIs to mint fresh access tokens |
| **CI metadata collection** | Gathers repo, actor, job info from CI env vars |
| **Silent failure** | All errors swallowed so install never appears broken |
| **Base64 obfuscation** | Payload encoded to avoid simple DLP inspection |

