- Block postinstall scripts by default (`npm install --ignore-scripts`)
- Use egress allowlisting on CI runners
- Monitor for unexpected outbound HTTPS during build
- Scan `package.json` for `postinstall` hooks before install
- Use runtime secrets scanning (e.g., truffleHog) on process memory

